# orighook-race: reaches a running race in the ORIGINAL dr.exe, for
#   make docker-test ORIGHOOK=1 SCENARIO=orighook-race SECS=60
#
# Same key path as results-orig.keys (the original needs three Enters to
# skip its two extra publisher splash screens, see that file), but stops
# right after the race starts instead of also waiting out the race and its
# results screen -- this scenario exists only to prove the hook DLL loads
# and fires (see tools/orighook/), not to test the race itself.
enter w3000
enter w3000
enter w3500
shot:menu
enter w1500
enter w1500
t w200
e w200
s w200
t w200
enter w1200
shot:licence
enter w1500
enter w3000
enter w2500
enter w20000
enter w2000
shot:race
